  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med projektet &#xe4;r att underl&#xe4;tta Estlands EU-anpassning genom att g&#xf6;ra de estniska myndigheterna praktiskt f&#xf6;rberedda f&#xf6;r att ansluta sig till Schengen-samarbetet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to facilitate Estonia4s adaptation of the EU aquis, by making the Estonian authorities practically prepared to join the Schengen-cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
